OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Flocally thundery, showers continuing
OL,7,Fthis evening and overnight mixed with
OL,8,Fclear spells. Staying very windy along
OL,9,Fthe coasts and over the Moors, with
OL,10,Fstronger gusts under any heavy showers.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FAnother mixed day with
OL,13,Foccasional sunny intervals and
OL,14,Fshowers, heavy at times with the risk
OL,15,Fof thunder. Strong winds towards the
OL,16,Fcoast, easing slightly later.
OL,17,FTemperatures close to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
